type: software
title: "Blinkit Customer Churn Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive data science project analyzing customer churn for Blinkit
  (quick commerce platform), combining exploratory data analysis (EDA),
  automated machine learning (H2O AutoML), and interactive Power BI dashboards
  to identify churn drivers and recommend retention strategies.
